# ytt — marathon complete

All in-scope work is done.  The `ytt` project is fully implemented per
`docs/plan/plan.md`.

## What was built

### Python package (`ytt/`)

All 19 modules:
- `__init__.py` (`__version__` = 0.1.0)
- `__main__.py`, `cli.py` (`ytt serve` / `ytt test` / `ytt selftest`)
- `config.py` — pydantic-settings, full Configuration table, startup validation
- `errors.py` — error_code constants + YttError
- `models.py` — TranscriptRequest/Result, Segment, WhisperJob, EgressReport
- `canonicalize.py` — URL → 11-char video_id, all forms, idempotence
- `parse_json3.py` — rolling-caption dedup (the #1 silent bug, fixed)
- `fetch.py` — yt-dlp json3 extraction, error taxonomy (13 seeds), language selection
- `concurrency.py` — SingleFlightRegistry + BoundedFetchPool
- `cache.py` — flat-file LRU, byte-cap Invariant 1, ENOSPC degrade, reconcile
- `auth.py` — FastMCP OAuth, path-bearing audience, path-inserted .well-known routes
- `authz.py` — subject allowlist + selftest --show-sub mechanism
- `ratelimit.py` — per-subject TokenBucket + WhisperQuota
- `whisper.py` — WhisperJob FSM, startup sweep, model guard, TTL GC
- `pagination.py` — cursor, chunking, filtering, loud PARTIAL, structuredContent
- `observability.py` — 9 Prometheus metrics, structlog JSON + redaction
- `selftest.py` — egress probe, is_residential derivation (23 ASNs + 21 org patterns)
- `canary.py` — long-running yt-dlp probe, Prometheus metrics :8081
- `server.py` — FastMCP app, tools, /health, /metrics, /admin/egress

