## Human-gated deploy steps (summary)

See `deploy/DEPLOY-CHECKLIST.md` for the full ordered checklist.  Key steps:

1. Write secrets to OpenBao (`ardenone-cluster/ytt/*`).
2. Create `ghcr-push-token` Secret in iad-ci (GitHub token with `write:packages`).
3. Copy manifests into `jedarden/declarative-config`.
4. Trigger first CI build (`ytt-build` WorkflowTemplate).
5. Verify ArgoCD app synced + ExternalSecret materialized.
6. Verify `/ytt/health` returns `{"status": "ok"}`.
7. Run ibkr regression gate (compare `.well-known/*` hashes before/after).
8. Complete OAuth flow + run `ytt selftest --show-sub` to discover subject.
9. Update `YTT_ALLOWED_SUBJECTS` in OpenBao + restart pod.
10. Verify transcript fetch works from Claude Desktop + mobile.
11. (Optional) Cloudflare WAF allowlist for `mcp.ardenone.com`.
12. Set GHCR package public + linked to repo.
13. Tag `v0.1.0` release.
